  "body_html": "<h1>VCG Truthfulness And Individual Rationality</h1>\n<p>Under the stated nonnegativity hypotheses, the VCG mechanism gives\nnonnegative truthful quasi-linear utility, is ex-post individually rational,\nand is dominant-strategy incentive compatible.</p>\n<h2>References</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>[EconCSLib PR #27, blueprint/src/content.tex, thm:md_vcg_results] EconCSLib pull request #27, https://github.com/gametheoryinlean/EconCSLib/pull/27. Migrated from the PR's old leanblueprint section into mdblueprint staged form.</li>\n</ul>",
